  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Youlima 1: Esther ASIFIWE KULIMUSHI</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project seeks to improve nutrition and incomes of farmers in Mudaka by establishing collection centers and purchasing beans, maize, and other vegetable products from farmers on a regular basis. The project also seeks to reduce post-harvest losses by setting up a vegetable processing center to transform and package raw produce into less perishable products, which will decrease reliance on external producers for these vegetables and increase their local consumption.</narrative>
  </description>
